%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 500ef08f4cfac4121a17369cfd788261, type: 3}
  m_Name: CH2-LVL2-SCENE2
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  sentences:
  - text: 'It''s happening again... the vision... '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: Atlas, try to calm down. What do you see?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: 'I see... a cosmic battle. Two celestial beings... immense, powerful. They
      clash with each other, their battles shaking the very fabric of the cosmos... '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: Could it be... the creation of the Titans and rogue beasts?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4da1349162b9249a983856943424b454, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4da1349162b9249a983856943424b454, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 157, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: 'When they clashed, they shattered... scattering fragments of their essence
      across the cosmos. As the fragments fell to Earth, they transformed into the
      Titans and rogue beasts. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4da1349162b9249a983856943424b454, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 157, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: So the Titans and rogue beasts are... remnants of these celestial beings?
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: Yes, but there's something else... One of the beings was filled with malicious
      intent. It feels like... like it's still out there.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 59764f4eef94842ba9b4f4a26e2e36dd, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 557, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: 'This could explain the rogue beasts'' recent behavior. They could be responding
      to this... malicious entity. '
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4da1349162b9249a983856943424b454, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4da1349162b9249a983856943424b454, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 157, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  - text: Luna run the simulation again. There must be a reason why I am suddenly
      seeing these frightening visions. I need to get stronger.
    speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
    actions:
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 238185b8d5a334aa2970362b639adf6c, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 0
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: -632, y: -132}
      moveSpeed: 0
    - speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 4da1349162b9249a983856943424b454, type: 2}
      spriteIndex: 1
      actionType: 1
      coords: {x: 157, y: -146}
      moveSpeed: 0
  background: {fileID: 21300000, guid: b8b0a888a1d724b7cacc1a876af51baa, type: 3}
  nextScene: {fileID: 0}
